  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -15.8pt; tab-stops: left blank 14.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=1><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">제시문을 읽고 물음에 답하시오</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P>\r\n<TABLE style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\">\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 295.26pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 9.66pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" vAlign=center colSpan=3>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 50.0pt left blank 100.0pt left blank 150.0pt left blank 200.0pt left blank 250.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 5.81pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 390.96pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" vAlign=center>\r\n<P style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=2>&nbsp; </P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 283.54pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 390.96pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" vAlign=center>\r\n<P style=\"tab-stops: left blank 30.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">여기 노란색과 초록색</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">두 가지 색의 색종이가 있습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">여</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">러분들은 이 색종이를 두 장씩 가질 수 있어요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">노란색이나 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">초록색만 각각 두 장을 가질 수도 있고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">노란색과 초록색을 한</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\" > </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">장씩 나눠 가질 수도 있지요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이렇게 가진 두 장의 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">색</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">종이를 한 장만 보이도록 잘 겹쳐서 책상위에 놓아</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\" > </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">보세요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이때 한 가지 규칙이 있습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">반드시 노란색 색종이가 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">초록색 색종이 위에 놓여야 한다는 것이죠</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"tab-stops: left blank 30.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">자</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이제 각자의 책상 위에 놓인 색종이를 봅시다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">노란색이 반드시 초록색보다 위에 와야 하기 때문에</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">노란색 두 장을 가진 사람도</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">노란색과 초록색을 한 장씩 가진 사람도 모두 겉보기에는 노란색 색종이만 보일 거예요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"tab-stops: left blank 30.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">만 초록색을 두 장 가진 사람만 초록색 종이가 보이겠지요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\" ></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"tab-stops: left blank 30.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">흰 물감과 검은 물감을 혼합하면 회색 물감이 나옵니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"tab-stops: left blank 30.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">또</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">빨간색 물감과 파란색 물감을 섞으면 보라색이 나오죠</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"tab-stops: left blank 30.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">하지만</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">한번 섞어 만든 회색 물감을 다시 흰색과 검은색</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">보라색 물감을 빨간색과 파란색 물감으로 되돌릴 수는</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\" > </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">없습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"tab-stops: left blank 30.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"tab-stops: left blank 30.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수도사인 멘델은 다양한 품종의 완두를 심고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이들을 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">인공적으로 교배하여 다양한 잡종들을 만들었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"tab-stops: left blank 30.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">그는 완두가 가지는 뚜렷한 대립형질을 찾아내었는데 특히</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">우성의 둥근 콩 순종 완두와 열성의 주름진 콩 순종 완두를 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">교배하여 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >F</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: sub; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">을 얻었으며</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">그 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >F</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: sub; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">을</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt\" > </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">자가 교배하여 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >F</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: sub; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">를 얻었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P></TD>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 5.91pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 390.96pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" vAlign=center>\r\n<P style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=2>&nbsp; </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 295.26pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 11pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" vAlign=center colSpan=3>\r\n<P style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=2>&nbsp; </P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; tab-stops: left blank 14.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=1><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"></SPA